# Run output only: large, regenerable, and LLM-produced, so none of it is tracked.
# Batch configs are the INPUT that makes a run reproducible, not output, and they live
# in ../configs/ where they are tracked normally. Do not add a config here.
#
# !.gitignore keeps this file itself visible; without it the '*' below hides the rule
# from anyone cloning the repository.
*
!.gitkeep
!.gitignore
